ATP fixture for VMC-ATP-026. Test instrumentation, not part of the product.

Sets the periodic world save interval from 200 ticks to 9,999,999 ticks (about 5.8 days),
so that only the shutdown flush can save a change made during the test.

Apply at the repository root:   git apply tools/atp/patches/<this file>
Remove it after the test:       git apply -R tools/atp/patches/<this file>

